	(gr_text "Seen from the front; the F side faces the display glass.\nOutline = the shell wall measured near its rim, 0.3 mm inside it.\nThe display module PCB sits here: a custom board of this outline replaces it or stacks behind it.\nNo screw bosses: hold the board like the display module, or glue in standoffs.\nDwgs.User shows the shell cut 0.5 mm behind the plane where the display PCB sits; the GPS hood is\nabove the top edge."
		(at 99.5055 141.3317 0)
